    "title": "WrestleMania 42 live streaming Countdown show: Night one",
    "text": "Geno Mrosko is a lifelong pro wrestling fan who has been covering it since becoming a Manager at Cageside Seats in 2011.WrestleMania 42 goes live on pay-per-view (PPV) and ESPN (or Netflix internationally) tonight (Sat., April 18, 2026) at 6 pm ET from Allegiant Stadium in Las Vegas, Nevada, but the promotion is also offering a free live stream of its Countdown show starting at 3:00 pm ET.There are no matches announced for the Countdown show, even though it will go for some three hours leading into the main broadcast. Plenty of time do a deep dive into the full card!There will be previews of all the matches on the PPV portion, analysis, breaking news, and more. The star studded pre-show panel of analysts will break down all the action before the PPV goes live.Latest Video from SB NationThe hottest NFL teams to ever reach the Super Bowl NEXT About Connatix Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEThroughout the 59 years spanning 1966-2024, the NFL produced 118 conference champions. As they entered the Super Bowl, they were all on a winning streak and playing at a high level to have won their conference, but there still exists a vast range of precisely how good. Focusing specifically on the latter stages of a season, who were the biggest juggernauts we've ever seen entering Super Sunday? And when that day rolled around, how exactly did that recent dominance manifest itself?The show starts at 3:00 pm ET, so remember to come back and join us here for the live stream you see above!Don’t forget to check out complete results and live match coverage of WrestleMania 42 night one by clicking here.1 Comment",
